# GENERATED by gen-xnu-sys-buck from xnu-sys/CMakeLists.txt. BOTH ARE GONE: the CMakeLists
# went with cmake (#82) and the generator was deleted once it could no longer run, so this
# file is now hand-maintained and git history is where the generator lives.
# Regenerate after an upstream bump; do not hand-edit.
#
# xnu-sys is the kernel-emulation glue that compiles the vendored XNU
# (osfmk/bsd) into libciderd_xnu_sys.a, which the Rust daemon links
# via XNU_SYS_LIB. Host tier: native ELF, no cross toolchain, no Mach-O.

